ar</p>\n</li>\n<li data-end=\"524\" data-start=\"513\">\n<p data-end=\"524\" data-start=\"515\" style=\"text-align: left;\">Structure</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 data-end=\"537\" data-start=\"526\" style=\"text-align: left;\">🔹 관리수업</h3>\n<ul data-end=\"590\" data-start=\"538\">\n<li data-end=\"551\" data-start=\"538\">\n<p data-end=\"551\" data-start=\"540\" style=\"text-align: left;\">VOCA TEST</p>\n</li>\n<li data-end=\"568\" data-start=\"552\">\n<p data-end=\"568\" data-start=\"554\" style=\"text-align: left;\">VOCA Writing</p>\n</li>\n<li data-end=\"583\" data-start=\"569\">\n<p data-end=\"583\" data-start=\"571\" style=\"text-align: left;\">Daily TEST</p>\n</li>\n<li data-end=\"590\" data-start=\"584\">\n<p data-end=\"590\" data-start=\"586\" style=\"text-align: left;\">모의고사</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 data-end=\"604\" data-start=\"592\" style=\"text-align: left;\">📅 수업 요일</h3>\n<ul data-end=\"627\" data-start=\"605\">\n<li data-end=\"627\" data-start=\"605\">\n<p data-end=\"627\" data-start=\"607\" style=\"text-align: left;\">정규 수업: 월/금, 화/목, 수/토</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 data-end=\"641\" data-start=\"629\" style=\"text-align: left;\">🎓 학년 구성</h3>\n<ul data-end=\"667\" data-start=\"642\">\n<li data-end=\"655\" data-start=\"642\">\n<p data-end=\"655\" data-start=\"644\" style=\"text-align: left;\">예비고1 / 고1</p>\n</li>\n<li data-end=\"662\" data-start=\"656\">\n<p data-end=\"662\" data-start=\"658\" style=\"text-align: left;\">고2</p>\n</li>\n<li data-end=\"667\" data-start=\"663\">\n<p data-end=\"667\" data-start=\"665\" style=\"text-align: left;\">고3</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 data-end=\"680\" data-start=\"669\" style=\"text-align: left;\">⭐ 레벨 구성</h3>\n<ul data-end=\"717\" data-start=\"681\">\n<li data-end=\"693\" data-start=\"681\">\n<p data-end=\"693\" data-start=\"683\" style=\"text-align: left;\">SI (실력반)</p>\n</li>\n<li data-end=\"706\" data-start=\"694\">\n<p data-end=\"706\" data-start=\"696\" style=\"text-align: left;\">HI (기본반)</p>\n</li>\n<li data-end=\"717\" data-s